WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:02.000
-Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.067
Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.400
You're here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.200
You're watching us.
Thank you very much.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.834
Guys, I want to say congrats
to the Kansas City Chiefs

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:14.033
and the Philadelphia Eagles
on advancing to Super Bowl LVII.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:17.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:20.234
Yeah, to all Chiefs fans,
I want to say congratulations.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:24.200
To all the Eagles fans,
I want to say good morning.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.734
You could tell Philly partied
hard last night because today,

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:30.200
the Rocky statue is holding up
Tylenol and a Gatorade.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.801
Of course, everyone in
Kansas City is just as pumped.

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:36.000
This is the Chiefs'
third Super Bowl appearance

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.868
in the last four years.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:41.367
Even Tom Brady is like, "Hey,
give someone else a chance."

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:43.133
Everyone is excited for
the Super Bowl.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.834
Half the country
will root for the Chiefs,

00:00:44.834 --> 00:00:46.234
half will root for the Eagles,

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:49.133
while Rob Lowe
is still rooting for the NFL.

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:55.534
I want that hat.
I want that hat.

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:58.367
He'll lend that to me.
I want to borrow that.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:00.834
Meanwhile, before becoming
coach of the Chiefs,

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:04.701
Andy Reid was head coach of
the Eagles for 14 years.

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:07.801
Here's a photo of him
then versus now.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:11.167
He looks exactly the same.

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:12.467
I don't know
how this is possible,

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:16.567
but somehow, Andy Reid
is the Paul Rudd of the NFL.

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:17.901
He looks great.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:19.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:24.567
And get this --
for the first time,

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.434
two brothers will be
facing off in the Super Bowl.

00:01:27.434 --> 00:01:29.501
Yep, Chiefs tight end
Travis Kelce

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:32.067
is playing against his brother,
Eagles center Jason Kelce.

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.701
Here they are. Yeah.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.334
And this is cute.

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:38.567
Their mom, Donna, goes to as
many of their games as possible,

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:41.434
and she even has a jersey that's
half Travis', half Jason's.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:45.133
Look at this.
Is that the best?

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.601
Is that the best?

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.601
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:51.701
When asked about
the Super Bowl, Donna said...

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:58.234
Then she said...

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:07.300
Then she said...

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:14.868
Finally, she said...

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:20.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:23.467
Tell it like it is.
What a proud mom.

00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.334
Switching gears,
some political news.

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:29.868
In a new video,
former president Trump

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:32.801
said that if re-elected,
he would protect the U.S.

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.434
from World War III by building

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:37.667
an impenetrable dome
over the country.

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:39.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.267 --> 00:02:43.934
Then Trump said,
"We're going to build a dome

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:46.200
and make Mars pay for it."

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:50.100
Trump was like, "Just think of
a dome as basically

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.667
a wall with a comb-over.

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:53.300
That's all.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.434
It's a wall with a comb-over."

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:57.334
Meanwhile, this weekend,
Trump was on his plane

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:58.901
and speaking to reporters
when he said

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:00.968
that Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:02.934
is acting like
he didn't shut down his state

00:03:02.934 --> 00:03:04.968
during the pandemic,
even though he did.

00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:06.000
Watch this.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.601
"Yeah, it's very hard
to rewrite history.

00:03:23.601 --> 00:03:26.300
Anyway, do you want to hear
more about how

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.901
I won the 2020 election?"

00:03:30.801 --> 00:03:33.534
Speaking of DeSantis, I saw that
he's actively preparing for

00:03:33.534 --> 00:03:36.234
a possible presidential run,
and he hasn't landed on

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:39.400
an official slogan yet,
but he's trying a few out.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.467
First, there's...

00:03:42.901 --> 00:03:44.200
Next, there's...

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:51.367
And, finally...

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.434
[ Cheers and applause ]
That could work.

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:57.133
That's interesting.

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:02.367
Well, some TV news.

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:05.868
CNN just suffered its worst week
of ratings in nine years.

00:04:05.868 --> 00:04:08.601
So to get ratings up, they've
introduced a new program --

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:12.234
"CNN Presents New Year's Eve
Every Day.

00:04:12.234 --> 00:04:14.167
I think I found
the solution to this problem.

00:04:14.167 --> 00:04:16.701
I think they need to add
one more person to their panel.

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:18.534
Yeah.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.367
There's 15 people on there.

00:04:23.701 --> 00:04:25.100
Well, this is wild.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.133
A 25-year-old hacker allegedly
stole the personal data

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:31.634
of everyone in Austria
and tried to sell it online.

00:04:31.634 --> 00:04:34.000
Yep, every single Austrian
got hacked.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.934
It's so bad, the country is
actually leaning into it.

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:37.534
Check out this ad I just saw.

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:42.167
-Come visit Austria, the country
of beautiful classical music,

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:43.434
delicious pastry,

00:04:43.434 --> 00:04:47.234
und Guenther, age 64,
who recently Googled,

00:04:47.234 --> 00:04:49.133
"What is MILF'?"

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:52.434
Walk the same streets as
Beethoven, Freud, und Klaus,

00:04:52.434 --> 00:04:55.767
who just bought 13 cat toys,
but he doesn't have a cat.

00:04:55.767 --> 00:04:57.033
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:57.033 --> 00:04:59.667
Here is his credit-card number.
Use it.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:04.234
Visit the Hofburg Palace,
the Vienna opera house, or Hans.

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:06.934
He lives at
536 Lindenstrasse Road.

00:05:06.934 --> 00:05:08.567
The key is under the mat.

00:05:08.567 --> 00:05:10.400
Hurry! He gets home at 6:00!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.367
Austria --
your identity will get stolen.

00:05:13.367 --> 00:05:14.567
Ja!"

00:05:14.567 --> 00:05:18.634
-Isn't that --
Interesting commercial, right?

00:05:18.634 --> 00:05:21.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:21.834 --> 00:05:22.968
They gave out the man's address.

00:05:22.968 --> 00:05:24.934
-That's great. That's fantastic.

00:05:24.934 --> 00:05:27.234
-Hey, guys,
it's National Meat Week.

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:29.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:29.801 --> 00:05:33.300
♪♪
-Yeah!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.701
